@ Ravaged Path, the cave under Route 204 between its south and north parts.
@ Laid out after Platinum's on Emerald's cave tileset. The south exit leads to
@ the cave mouth in Route 204's lower cliff, the east exit to the one on its
@ middle plateau. Most of the cave is joined by water, so the north-east room
@ and the shores along the channel need Surf.
@ Platinum's LUCK INCENSE is an AMULET COIN here: this game has no Luck
@ Incense, and the Amulet Coin has the same held effect (double prize money).
